<Document style="helpdocument">
	<p style="htitle">Refinery</p>
	<p style="hp">Refineries convert <a href="petroleum">petroleum</a> into <a href="goods">goods</a>. They consume petroleum and labor to produce goods.</p>
	<p style="hp">Refineries need <a href="labor">labor</a> and a supply of petroleum to operate.</p>

  <p style="hp">This is a refinery</p>
   <img src="images/tiles/refinery-empty.png" halign="center"/>

  <p style="hp">and this is its icon</p>
   <img src="images/gui/buttonpanel/industry/refinery.png" halign="center"/>

	<p style="hsubtitle">Formulas</p>
	<p style="hp">1: 200 labor + 5 petroleum =&gt; 3 goods</p>
	<p style="hp">Refineries target producing goods as long as labor and petroleum are available.</p>

